    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Don't know what country I'm in, but I know how I'm feelin' (My body's always right)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I knew I must've dropped my diary in the pool for a reason (Erased your every line)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Did you forget the kind of bitch with whom you're dealing? (If so, I can remind)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Yeah, I can fall in love hard, turn around and delete it (So I'm)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Tryin' on shoes, puttin' on glitter",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Anything to make me a little less bitter",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Favorite blue, take a pretty picture",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Got you like, \"Fuck\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You'll swear to God that I'm someone else",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "post-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I can't stop",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You piss me off and I'll turn it out",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I can't stop",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You roll your eyes at all my shows, and God knows I see it (All I see is you)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I used to idolize you, baby, took a year to reveal it (And the hard truth)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Is I'm not what you need, it's hard to believe",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You need a girl that isn't me, warmin' the seat",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Stayin' at home, it's hard to compete with someone I'm not",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And someone that I'll never be (So I'm)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
