          "n": "0",
          "text": "(Ah) And maybe I'm not the girl that you thought",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Or maybe you loved me once, but forgot (Ah, ah)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So, baby, go back to puttin' up a front (Mm, ah)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "(Ah) And guess I thought wrong for thinkin' you'd wait, 'cause",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
